# ("no ebuilds built with USE flags to satisfy ...[python...]") and NOTHING in
# packages.list merges. Caught by the first x86 desktop build ever run to this
# phase (2026-07-08); the builder's AUTOUNMASK-PRETEND replay listed exactly
# this one change.
#
# role-INDEPENDENT (no case entry in build-x86-host-stage4.sh's package.use copy
# loop) because app-admin/calamares is a PKGS atom for ANY role when
# --installer-ui=calamares|all (WANT_CALAMARES), not just ROLE_CLIENT — this
# line used to live in package.use/desktop, which the copy loop gates on
# ROLE_CLIENT, so node images (pki/be/fe/be+gpu/omnibus) hit the identical
# boost[python] resolution wall ~16min in. Real 5x x86 node-image failure,
# session 20260716-160638-f8c153.
dev-libs/boost python
